#: ../../source/yargs_README.md:678
msgid "dot notation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yargs_README.md:681
msgid ""
"When you use dots (`.`s) in argument names, an implicit object path is "
"assumed. This lets you organize arguments into nested objects."
msgstr ""

